        Part of review comment 22/85.
    Signed-off-by: Benny Halevy <bhalevy-C4P08NqkoRlBDgjK7y7TUQ@public.gmane.org>
    [nfs41: use find_last_bit in nfs4_free_slot to determine highest used=
 slot.]
    Signed-off-by: Benny Halevy <bhalevy-C4P08NqkoRlBDgjK7y7TUQ@public.gmane.org>
    [nfs41: rpc_sleep_on slot_tbl_waitq must be called under slot_tbl_loc=
k]
        Otherwise there's a race (we've hit) with nfs4_free_slot where
        nfs41_setup_sequence sees a full slot table, unlocks slot_tbl_loc=
