    fbdev: add support for handoff from firmware to hw framebuffers
   =20
    With KMS we have ran into an issue where we really want the KMS fb dr=
iver
    to be the one running the console, so panics etc can be shown by swit=
ching
    out of X etc.
   =20
    However with vesafb/efifb built-in, we end up with those on fb0 and t=
he
    KMS fb driver on fb1, driving the same piece of hw, so this adds an f=
b
    info flag to denote a firmware fbdev, and adds a new aperture base/si=
ze
    range which can be compared when the hw drivers are installed to see =
if
    there is a conflict with a firmware driver, and if there is the firmw=
are
    driver is unregistered and the hw driver takes over.
