    V4L/DVB (11964): b2c2: Fix problems with frontend attachment
   =20
    The frontend attachment code didn't handle cases where the frontend
    partially failed to attach.  For instance, when the demod was attache=
d
    successfully but the tuner driver wasn't compiled or fails to init fo=
r some
    reason.  In these cases we try to clean up the partial attachment and=
 fail
    instead of proceeding with a broken frontend.
   =20
    If frontend registration fails, clean up with dvb_frontend_detach() r=
ather
    than just calling the frontend's main release method.  The former doe=
s some
    additional stuff, like release an attached tuner and take care of put=
ting
    symbols when dynamic binding is used.
   =20
    In skystar2_rev23_attach() it's not necessary to set fc->dev_type, th=
at
    gets set before skystar2_rev23_attach() is called.
