    Blackfin: fix deadlock in SMP IPI handler
   =20
    When a low priority interrupt (like ethernet) is triggered between 2 =
high
    priority IPI messages, a deadlock in disable_irq() is hit by the seco=
nd
    IPI handler.  This is because the second IPI message is queued within=
