   =20
      Oh and btw, your patch alone doesn't fix powerpc, because it's miss=
ing
      a whole bunch of GFP_KERNEL's in the arch code... You would have to
      grep the entire kernel for things that check slab_is_available() an=
d
      even then you'll be missing some.
   =20
      For example, slab_is_available() didn't always exist, and so in the
      early days on powerpc, we used a mem_init_done global that is set f=
orm
