    Fingerprints can be downloaded from
    http://www.openbsd.org/cgi-bin/cvsweb/src/etc/pf.os
    or can be found in archive
   =20
    Example usage:
    -d switch removes fingerprints
   =20
    Please consider for inclusion.
    Thank you.
