    TASK_STOPPED case.  Because the untraced child can dequeue SIGSTOP an=
d
    call do_signal_stop() before ptrace_detach() calls wake_up_process().
   =20
    Revert this change for now.  We need some fixes even if we we want to=
 keep
    the current behaviour, but these fixes are not for 2.6.30.
