   =20
              <idle>-0     [002] 34263.745825: raise_softirq_irqoff <-__b=
lk_complete_request
              <idle>-0     [002] 34263.745826:
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
   =20
    By returning "0" instead, the irq stack is saved as well, and we see:
   =20
              <idle>-0     [003]   883.280992: raise_softirq_irqoff <-__h=
rtimer_star
    t_range_ns
              <idle>-0     [003]   883.280992:
     <=3D hrtimer_start_range_ns
     <=3D tick_nohz_restart_sched_tick
     <=3D cpu_idle
     <=3D start_secondary
     <=3D
     <=3D 0
     <=3D 0
   =20
    [ Impact: record stacks from interrupts ]
   =20
    Signed-off-by: Steven Rostedt <rostedt-nx8X9YLhiw1AfugRpC6u6w@public.gmane.org>

